      Note","body":"so we spawned one of each at start, now deal with left over spaces","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"ac672650-2746-4641-be23-49aaae4fe327","$type":"Unity.VisualScripting.StickyNote"},{"position":{"xMin":335.0,"yMin":490.0,"xMax":581.0,"yMax":635.0},"title":"Sticky
      Note","body":"get boundaries of the spawn area collider to get the range of
